export anchor GreekClassicalStyle:
    number: 146
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Greek classical
    idea: The dashboard is painted round a black-figure vase, in stacked registers shaped like its silhouette, framed by Greek key bands, with the four totals in terracotta tondo medallions.
    base: light
    palette:
        clay: #f6e7d4, the page between registers
        lightClay: #fbf3e8, register grounds, cards and fields
        slip: #d27a48, terracotta fills, key band grounds, medallion rings, the primary button and last week bars
        deepTerracotta: #8e3b14, ivy marks and focus
        blackGlaze: #1c1612, text, key lines, amphora fills, the top bar, frieze heads and this week bars
        umber: #5c4636, dates, meta and captions
        miltos: #8a2b1a, overdue and Behind
        olive: #3f5320, On track
        ochre: #7a5200, At risk
        addedWhite: #fffaf2, text on black glaze
    type:
        Baskerville, Baskerville Old Face, Libre Baskerville, Hoefler Text,
        Garamond, serif for the greeting, figures, titles and body.
        Labels use Gill Sans, Gill Sans MT, Seravek, Trebuchet MS,
        sans-serif in caps tracked 0.08 to 0.2em. Greeting 46px, tondo
        figures 50px, register titles 28px, project names 19px on black,
        labels 13 to 15px, body 15 to 16px at 1.55.
    layout:
        Registers stacked down the centre with widths that trace a vase,
        a narrow neck for the header at 820px, a shoulder at 1100px for
        the greeting and totals, the widest belly at 1240px for projects,
        a hip at 1040px for chart and activity and a narrow foot at 640px.
        The neck is a black bar with the brand and a small amphora mark,
        a pill search, a terracotta pill button, a ring bell and the user,
        then a Greek key band, the pill nav with a black current pill and
        a row of black tongues. The shoulder opens with a dotted band, a
        centred greeting, the date in spaced caps and a red pill naming 4
        overdue tasks, then four round tondi, terracotta discs with black
        rings and a clay centre holding the figure, with Overdue inverted
        to a black centre. The belly is a six panel frieze split by black
        lines, each panel with a black head holding category and name, an
        amphora that fills with black glaze to its percent, the percent,
        tasks and due date, and the status. The hip pairs the chart,
        terracotta then black round tipped bars, with the activity list
        led by ivy leaves. Key bands close each register. On phones the
        frieze goes two across and tondi two by two.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 24 to 32px register padding, 20px between registers, 24px between tondi.
    density: Medium. Each register holds one kind of content.
    corners: Square registers and panels. Round tondi, pill buttons, pill fields, pill nav and round tipped bars.
    borders: 3px black lines between frieze panels, 24px Greek key bands with black edges, dotted and tongue bands as lighter dividers.
    shadows: None.
    icons:
        Black-figure silhouettes. An amphora shows progress and ivy leaves
        mark activity. Status uses a filled diamond for On track, an
        outlined triangle with a mark for At risk and a hollow square for
        Behind, beside the caps word.
    focus: A 2px deep terracotta outline offset 3px, terracotta on the black bar.
    tone: Plain and calm, with one painterly aside per register such as Each vessel fills with black glaze.
